{
  "case": "kordic_cerkez",
  "case_id": null,
  "date": "1998-11-27",
  "utterances": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "speaker": "JUDGE JORDA",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Please be seated. Have the accused brought in, please. (The accused entered court)"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "speaker": "JUDGE JORDA",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Good morning to the interpreters. I want to make sure that everybody can hear me, that the equipment is working right. Good morning to the Defence. Good morning to the Prosecution. Good morning to the accused. Welcome to Mr. Roeland Bos. We hope that he won't spend too much time with us, not because we don't like him, but because our usual registrar has some family problems today, and he had to leave. Thank you, Mr. Bos, for having agreed to replace him. We will now give the floor to the Defence for the introduction of the new witness this morning, and we will work until 1.30, as we usually do on Friday, with two breaks, two, perhaps, 15-minute breaks, but we can see. Mr. Hayman, please go ahead."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "speaker": "MR. HAYMAN",
      "role": "counsel",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Thank you, Mr. President. Good morning, Your Honours. The next witness, Mr. President, this morning has asked to testify in a closed session, and I can explain the witness's rational for that if, perhaps, we go into private session for the moment."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "speaker": "JUDGE JORDA",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "All right. Let's have a private session so that Mr. Hayman can explain why he wants the session to be closed. (Private session)"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "speaker": "JUDGE JORDA",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "(Closed session)"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "speaker": "JUDGE JORDA",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "1.36 p.m., to be reconvened on Monday, the 7th day of December, 1998, at 2.00 p.m. 22 23 24 25"
    }
  ],
